title: M3_PRESENTATION_START
---
<<vn_bg m3_bg_a>>
CHECKPOINT BG-01 — Background A must be visible. #line:09228cc

<<vn_show m3_a default far_left>>
CHECKPOINT A-00 — Character A must be visible at FarLeft with Body + default Head. BackHair is intentionally absent. #line:0242da9

<<vn_move m3_a far_left>>
CHECKPOINT A-01 — Character A must now be at FarLeft. #line:038c28e

<<vn_move m3_a left>>
CHECKPOINT A-02 — Character A must now be at Left. #line:03a3bfc

<<vn_move m3_a center>>
CHECKPOINT A-03 — Character A must now be at Center. #line:0c5d6df

<<vn_move m3_a right>>
CHECKPOINT A-04 — Character A must now be at Right. #line:03c78ed

<<vn_move m3_a far_right>>
CHECKPOINT A-05 — Character A must now be at FarRight. #line:01d1845

<<vn_hide m3_a>>
CHECKPOINT A-06 — Character A must now be hidden. #line:0858be1

<<vn_show m3_b default far_left>>
CHECKPOINT B-00 — Character B must be visible alone at FarLeft. #line:05bde66

<<vn_move m3_b far_left>>
CHECKPOINT B-01 — Character B must now be at FarLeft. #line:0e9e078

<<vn_move m3_b left>>
CHECKPOINT B-02 — Character B must now be at Left. #line:016c168

<<vn_move m3_b center>>
CHECKPOINT B-03 — Character B must now be at Center. #line:0f977db

<<vn_move m3_b right>>
CHECKPOINT B-04 — Character B must now be at Right. #line:029751e

<<vn_move m3_b far_right>>
CHECKPOINT B-05 — Character B must now be at FarRight. #line:04d183f

<<vn_hide m3_b>>
CHECKPOINT B-06 — Character B must now be hidden. #line:02b2787

<<vn_show m3_a default left>>
CHECKPOINT FOCUS-00A — Character A must be visible alone at Left before the dual-character test. #line:018947f

<<vn_show m3_b default right>>
CHECKPOINT FOCUS-00 — Characters A and B must both be visible at Left and Right. #line:0eb0cfc

M3 A: CHECKPOINT FOCUS-01 — This is the A speaker-focus test. A must be active brightness and B must be dimmed. #line:0e10e2d
M3 B: CHECKPOINT FOCUS-02 — This is the B speaker-focus test. B must be active brightness and A must be dimmed. #line:0648634
CHECKPOINT FOCUS-03 — This narration line has no speaker. A and B must both return to active brightness. #line:0f5bbe0

<<vn_hide m3_b>>
CHECKPOINT EXP-00 — Character B must now be hidden; only Character A remains for the expression test. #line:029425f

<<vn_move m3_a center>>
CHECKPOINT EXP-01 — Character A must be at Center with the DEFAULT Head. #line:0767627

<<vn_expression m3_a smile>>
CHECKPOINT EXP-02 — Character A must now show the SMILE Head while Body, slot, facing, and scale remain unchanged. #line:0accf6d

<<vn_expression m3_a default>>
CHECKPOINT EXP-03 — Character A must return to the DEFAULT Head. #line:0a687f2

<<vn_facing m3_a right>>
CHECKPOINT FACE-01 — Character A must face right as the known baseline; Body and Head must be aligned. #line:0f76022

<<vn_facing m3_a left>>
CHECKPOINT FACE-02 — Character A must face left; Body and Head must flip together through CharacterVisualRoot. #line:0f26fab

<<vn_scale m3_a 1.0>>
CHECKPOINT SCALE-01 — Character A must be at scale 1.0. #line:0daf390

<<vn_scale m3_a 1.1>>
CHECKPOINT SCALE-02 — Character A must now be approximately 10% larger, with Body and Head still aligned. #line:0189c8d

<<vn_bg m3_bg_b>>
CHECKPOINT BG-02 — Background B must be visible while Character A and the dialogue UI remain present. #line:0519ac7

<<vn_cg m3_cg>>
CHECKPOINT CG-01 — CG must be visible above background/character presentation while dialogue UI remains visible. #line:07386fb

<<vn_clear_cg>>
CHECKPOINT CG-02 — CG must be gone and the underlying Background B + Character A presentation must still exist. #line:0642fcc

<<vn_hide m3_a>>
CHECKPOINT FINAL-01 — No characters must remain visible. #line:0d7a1e4

M3 PRESENTATION SMOKE COMPLETE — user verification can now stop. #line:0df4725
===
